                                                "sense_id": "83fe0d18-1b21-3dc6-ab11-7ed14cd53672",
                                                "text": "\"Alumni could become more active in giving guidance and leadership to students. They act as sort of a 'maturity governor' on fraternities,\" notes Ratliff, citing surveys suggesting that fraternity actives presume mistakenly that alumni want hazing […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
